msgstr "追加装甲受损"

#: slot/0x002e0fee/0x1a3e77/0x95f2ab
msgid "Jet Pack Damaged"
msgstr "喷射包损坏"

#: slot/0x002e0fee/0x1a3e77/0x97e770
msgid "Customize Metal Gear ZEKE's parts by setting the walk unit, power unit, leg parts, head parts, and optional parts."
msgstr "设置步行、动力、腿部、头部及可选组件，定制合金装备·ZEKE部件。"

#: slot/0x002e0fee/0x1a3e77/0x99d00d
msgid "A walk unit for Metal Gear ZEKE. The most basic part."
msgstr "合金装备·ZEKE的步行组件。最基础的部件。"

#: slot/0x002e0fee/0x1a3e77/0xa087ff
msgid "Head parts taken from Chrysalis. Equipped with a built-in guided missile launcher."
msgstr "取自蝶蛹的头部组件。内置制导导弹发射器。"

#: slot/0x002e0fee/0x1a3e77/0xa67781
msgid "Head parts taken from Cocoon. Equipped with a large-caliber cannon."
msgstr "取自茧的头部组件。装备大口径加农炮。"

#: slot/0x002e0fee/0x1a3e77/0xac387c
msgid ""
"The Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM> does not contain the required VOCALOID voice data.\n"
"Please create data from EXTRAS under the title menu.\n"
"To create data you must be connected to the PlayStation<I=REG>Network."
msgstr ""
"存储<I=BL>卡<I=TM>中没有所需的VOCALOID语音数据。\n"
"请从标题菜单的EXTRAS中创建数据。\n"
"创建数据需要连接PlayStation<I=REG>Network。"

